  "text": "CONTRADICTING: In a second (female, UCI5) isogenic pair, debris-challenged APOE44 iMG late endosomes/lysosomes did not acidify and instead shifted toward alkalinization (higher pH), while APOE33 acidified (reported: 0.15 pH units (APOE44+debris ~5.40 vs APOE33+debris ~5.24)).",
  "description": "Isogenic APOE33/APOE44 UCI5 (UCI ADRC, female) human iPSC-derived microglia, untreated or treated with organoid debris. Ratiometric ApHID/Alexa647 dextran LE/Ly pH imaging. n=3 wells per condition, 25 frames per well; unpaired two-tailed t-test. Caveat: microglia, not astrocytes; late endosome/lysosome compartment.",
